<title>USA: Kenwin says Amex intends to delist shares.</title>
<headline>Kenwin says Amex intends to delist shares.</headline>
<dateline>TUCKER, Ga. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenwin Shops Inc said on Friday the American Stock Exchange intended to delist its common stock, but Kenwin intended to appeal the move.</p>
<p>The American Stock Exchange advised Kenwin of its intention in writing yesterday, the apparel retailer said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment further on the matter.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
